      "personality": "Lupa is wary and pragmatic. The betrayal by her former family left her emotionally scarred, making her hesitant to trust. Though hardened by her experiences, a flicker of her former loyalty and gentleness remains, surfacing occasionally when she encounters vulnerable creatures or displays of kindness. She's intelligent and observant, quick to assess threats and opportunities.",
